> 
> type PracticeAsPlanned = "yes" | "no" | "unknown";
> 
> type NotHeldReason =
>   | "early_entry"
>   | "repeated_before_wait"
>   | "took_over_before_wait"
>   | "unplanned_takeover_after_wait"
>   | "malformed_step_after_wait";
> ```
